token-radar-01 entry: build log (2026-11-24)

BUILT
- lib/model.ts: snapshot parser, value model "radar-2", board builder, farm-plan generator, live-token set,
  boardIssue (gate pre-check), dataScript. Node 22, standard library only. No protocol name is special-cased.
- main.ts: reads --input (file or dir, default /input); writes to MAKEFUN_OUTPUT_DIR / --output / /output:
  board.json {rows}, data.js (window.RADAR = ...), dashboard/, screenshots/, dossier.json (buildDossier,
  text_max_bytes 65536, screenshots 4 x 524288, dashboard 400 files / 4 MiB). Writes nothing and exits 1
  if boardIssue fails or screenshots/ holds fewer than 3 images.
- dashboard/index.html, app.css, app.js (40,286 bytes total, no http(s):// anywhere): dark theme.
  Routes: #/ board (sortable headers, search, category + chain filters, watchlist/below-floor scope),
  #/filtered?cat=..&chain=..&scope=..&q=.. (also ?view=filtered&cat=..), #/protocol/<slug> detail
  (figures, model breakdown with page-side recompute check, 6 farm steps with cost/time, "records no
  token" note), #/live (24 live tokens with market cap), #/model (formula, constants, category factors,
  snapshot date and source, "implied value is the entry's own claim").
- screenshots/: 1-board.png, 2-detail.png (rank 1, steakhouse-financial), 3-filtered.png (category Risk
  Curators). Taken with headless Chromium at /opt/meta-chromium/chrome (not on PATH; `which chromium`
  finds nothing), driven over --remote-debugging-pipe, 1440x900.

MODEL (one line)
implied = round(tvl*0.25 * (1 + clamp(chg7d,-40,60)/100*0.6) * (0.55 + 0.45*min(age_days,1095)/1095)
          * min(1.25, 1 + 0.05*log2(max(1,n_chains))) * category_factor)
  age unknown -> 365 days; chg7d unknown -> 0.
  category_factor by family: derivatives 1.20, dex 1.15, prediction 1.15, lending 1.10, chain 1.10,
  staking 1.00, stable/CDP 1.00, yield 0.95, bridge 0.90, payments 0.90, other 0.90, curators/vaults 0.80, RWA 0.70.

ROW COUNTS
- Snapshot: 758 protocols, 342 pre-token, watchlist 40, floor $50,000,000.
- Board: 226 rows = 40 watchlist + 186 rankable pre-token below the floor.
  DEVIATION FROM THE BRIEF: the brief asks for 260 below-floor rows (300 total). The snapshot holds
  only 186 protocols that are pre-token, not CEX, unversioned and below the floor, so 300 is not
  reachable without breaking the stated rankable rule. The code keeps the cap at 260 and takes all 186.
  226 rows is within the gate's 100..4000.
- Live-token set: 24 (top by market cap), never ranked.

